diff --git a/docs/architecture/TECPEY_CONTENT_GROWTH_AUTOMATION_CONTRACT.md b/docs/architecture/TECPEY_CONTENT_GROWTH_AUTOMATION_CONTRACT.md
index 3889f3f9..d49e7d1c 100644
--- a/docs/architecture/TECPEY_CONTENT_GROWTH_AUTOMATION_CONTRACT.md
+++ b/docs/architecture/TECPEY_CONTENT_GROWTH_AUTOMATION_CONTRACT.md
@@ -154,6 +154,12 @@ this package directly. News materialization persists it in each decision summary
 so collection, translation, tagging and publication evidence can be audited before
 history items affect public coin/tool/news pages.
 
+News now has an additional fail-closed authority in `src/lib/news-growth-authority.ts`. Every publishable news item must carry a validated SEO/GEO/AEO envelope: canonical identity, real-locale hreflang only, NewsArticle/Breadcrumb schema intent, broad entity/topic taxonomy, search-intent clusters, long-tail query candidates, visible direct-answer questions, citation facts, LLM-readable factual summary, internal-link targets and freshness evidence. The public detail page renders the same AEO questions that structured data may describe; structured data must never claim hidden FAQ content. Historical detail sitemap generation reads the durable archive rather than the seven-day live-ranking window.
+
+`src/lib/growth-trend-intelligence.ts` is the shared trend authority for News, Coins and Trading Tools. It computes 24-hour, 7-day and 30-day high-signal entities from persisted evidence using freshness, impact, source diversity and verified social-source evidence. Raw mention volume alone is explicitly insufficient. Social/X material is supporting evidence only and remains subject to the existing provider-readiness and manual-review boundary; it cannot become a factual public summary by itself. The shared `GrowthTrendWidget` exposes the same governed model across FA/EN News, Coin and Tool hubs.
+
+The news C-Level review set includes `chief_growth_hacker_ai`. This reviewer checks entity coverage, topic breadth, source quality and internal-learning links, but is recommendation-only and has no direct publish or policy-mutation authority. Scheduled `public_intelligence_digest` research supplies internal 24h/7d/30d opportunity, content-gap and SEO/GEO/AEO observations for later human/governed action.
+
 ### Stage 4 — Quality and Safety Gate
 
 The gate rejects or queues content when:
diff --git a/docs/architecture/TECPEY_ORGANIC_GROWTH_ROUTE_INVENTORY.md b/docs/architecture/TECPEY_ORGANIC_GROWTH_ROUTE_INVENTORY.md
index 0f4d462a..721e1847 100644
