+++ b/docs/architecture/TECPEY_ORGANIC_GROWTH_ROUTE_INVENTORY.md
@@ -73,3 +73,11 @@ Every future implementation should preserve these hooks:
 - Mentor AI operational-memory retrieval for repeated incidents, content rejections and support/debug patterns.
 - Account bridge from Academy account to the final TecPey exchange account.
 - Page-by-page screenshots and browser accessibility evidence.
+
+### 2026-09 governed growth expansion
+
+- News, Coin and Trading Tool hubs share one trend-intelligence widget with 24h/7d/30d windows.
+- News publication is fail-closed on `NewsGrowthAuthority` (SEO + GEO + AEO), source/translation quality, topic/entity tags and safety boundaries.
+- The daily archive is keyed by `Asia/Tehran`, keeps historical days accessible, and never backfills today's feed with yesterday's headlines.
+- Social signals from X/Reddit/YouTube/Telegram can increase trend confidence only when they are stored as verifiable supporting evidence; raw mention counts and unverified social rumors never create a public trend alone.
+- Search growth is built through useful topic authority and internal entity graphs, not doorway pages, keyword stuffing or scaled thin content.
